-- Two constructors, which plan 53 §11.4 found as unenforced as the field
-- count and which neither the plan's criterion 2 nor its leaf 2 mentions.
-- This emitted `enum Shade { Light, Dark }` plus a `use Shade::*;` and
-- exited 0 — an enum, from the one keyword whose whole content is that it is
-- not one.
--
-- `data Shade = Light | Dark` is the declaration that was meant.
newtype Shade = Light | Dark
